  "item_highlights": {
    "c344b80ad07ba70e09bc71ca01268cc7550deae8e61c846aa15b30403c338286": [
      {
        "id": "1783214830372-V2UgcGFpciB2YWx1ZS",
        "text": "We pair value with embedded catalysts - a discounted stock only interests us when the market is also materially underestimating where its earnings and key metrics are headed over the next 6 to 24 months.",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:27:10.372Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783214839188-VGhlIHJlLXJhdGluZy",
        "text": "The re-rating comes when the market is forced to upgrade its consensus estimates for those material KPIs.",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:27:19.188Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783214902238-QmlnIHRlY2ggd2lsbC",
        "text": "Big tech will cut costs by designing custom compute (ASICs) and finding more efficient ways to use memory.",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:28:22.238Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783214914604-Y3V0",
        "text": "cut",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:28:34.604Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783214929304-QmlnIHRlY2ggd2lsbC",
        "text": "Big tech will cut costs by designing custom compute (ASICs) and finding more efficient w",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:28:49.304Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783214934370-ZyB0ZWNoIHdpbGwgY3",
        "text": "g tech will cut costs by designing custom compute (ASICs) and find",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:28:54.370Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783214937021-bCBjdXQgY29zdHMgYn",
        "text": "l cut costs by designing custom compute (ASICs) and find",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:28:57.021Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783215032738-QSBwYXVzZSBvciBhIH",
        "text": "A pause or a second look at capital expenditure on building out AI data centers may be around the corner.",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:30:32.738Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783215090103-VGhpcyB3aWxsIHNoaW",
        "text": "This will shift more of the value in the AI stack towards cloud providers and away from frontier labs and semis.",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:31:30.103Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783215128086-VGhlIEdMUC0xIHJlbG",
        "text": "The GLP-1 related headwinds are affecting this group as well (healthier people lead to lower need for medical devices).",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:32:08.086Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783215131003-VGhlIEdMUC0xIHJlbG",
        "text": "The GLP-1 related headwinds",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:32:11.003Z"
      }
    ],
    "b67a6c016dafd6d9e6f6b29b0cfad4fd43ecbac93c08bdfed8e4edcac0a06970": [
      {
        "id": "1783215688666-QUkgd2VhcmFibGVzIG",
        "text": "AI wearables are a bet that if AI could see and hear what you do and remember it for you, it would become exponentially more valuable.",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:41:28.666Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1783215717415-VGhlIHF1ZXN0aW9uIG",
        "text": "The question is not whether AI wearable technology will work. It is whether we are comfortable with a world in which memory is no longer scarce, and forgetting is no longer the default.",
        "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:41:57.415Z"
      }
    ]
  },
